On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "Now you have to go through a portal into another world and fight devils there."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "You must first fight [60Devil] Vapula and [72Devil] Andromalius then [36Devil] Storas, the crow's noble. Be fully prepared for they are strong and have many men.\n\nWe must give Bros of [Order of the Sorcery] of Ronark Land the seal Scrolls for [36Devil] Storas, [60Devil] Vapula, and [72Devil] Andromalius."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Now you have to go through a portal into another world and fight devils there."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "You must first fight [60Devil] Vapula and [72Devil] Andromalius then [36Devil] Storas, the crow's noble. Be fully prepared for they are strong and have many men.\n\nWe must give Sais of [Order of the Sorcery] of Ronark Land the seal Scrolls for [36Devil] Storas, [60Devil] Vapula, and [72Devil] Andromalius."

On in_progress
    Say "You haven't sealed yet? Then I will send you again to them."

On claimable
    Show quest "You have sealed them up for sure. With this, we can seal three more devils."

On completed
    If player is karus
        Say "I see you have much more power and you'll be able to fight against the stronger devils, <selfname>. Therefore, I'm going to ask you to seal [Devil 12] Prince Sitri this time. He's a Prince of Devildom. He can control everything related to the love and sex of people with magic. Bring the [Devil 12 Summoning Scroll] that I gave you, and go to the [Luferson Castle], where the [Devil 12 Summoning Stone] is located. You can summon and destroy him there."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "I see you have much more power and you'll be able to fight against the stronger devils, <selfname>. Therefore, I'm going to ask you to seal [Devil 12] Prince Sitri this time. He's a Prince of Devildom. He can control everything related to the love and sex of people with magic. Bring the [Devil 12 Summoning Scroll] that I gave you, and go to the [El Morad] Castle, where the [Devil 12 Summoning Stone] is located. You can summon and destroy him there."
